* WELL-BULK VARIANT (2026-08-25): the bulk-ported std-cell CDL, not _no_bulk.
* _no_bulk collapses every device bulk onto the cell's OWN VDD / VSS port, so
* in a header-gated row it asserts n-well = VDD_SW while the layout has the
* n-well on always-on VDD (addWellTap FILLBIASA10TH, globalNetConnect
* VNW->VDD).  That mismatch produced ~60k "B: VDD | ** missing connection **"
* terminal lines per power net and made a real well-bias defect unreportable.
* lvs.sh binds VNW=VDD VPW=VSS on every A10TH instance line.
* See lvs_include_tile for the long-form note.
